],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Benton County has a rain record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids August to September and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years. In 2025 that middle ran 28% of normal in January to February and 44% of normal in September to October. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, and grid 26251 bottomed out at 52% of normal that year.</p>"}
